(a) Any person who requires a permit under Section 11-4-2520 to operate or maintain a recycling facility shall submit to the Commissioner a written annual report summarizing all recycling activities occurring at the facility during each calendar year. The annual report required under this section shall be submitted by such person to the department no later than February 28th of each year, following the calendar year to which such report relates. Such report shall contain the following data and information:

